{"id":"n73448-1-9","stage":5,"title":"여우 · 狐狸","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73448-1-9-1","ko":"저 뒷산에는 산짐승들이 여럿 있어요.","zh":"那座后面的山上有很多野生动物。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"뒷산에는","meaning":"后山","explanation":"뒷산：后山；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"뒷산","audio":"/audio/67e40a6de3acce11076e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67401","senseId":"1","lemma":"뒷산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뒷산에는","audio":"/audio/6ffdd3fbd06b197aa3ef.mp3"}},{"text":"산짐승들이","meaning":"野兽","explanation":"산짐승：野兽；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"산짐승","audio":"/audio/38f6115d3f97fe270818.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61809","senseId":"1","lemma":"산짐승","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"산짐승들이","audio":"/audio/6a5f4db76e2cd46342ff.mp3"}},{"text":"여럿","meaning":"多个，许多","explanation":"여럿：多个，许多","readings":[{"term":"여럿","audio":"/audio/4bd2b4778a4cf299cd75.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15207","senseId":"1","lemma":"여럿","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여럿","audio":"/audio/4bd2b4778a4cf299cd75.mp3"}},{"text":"있어요.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어요","audio":"/audio/499f8423f214354759ff.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"67e40a6de3acce11","term":"뒷산","zh":"后山","audio":"/audio/67e40a6de3acce11076e.mp3","entryId":"67401","definition":"家或村子后面的山。","pronunciation":["뒤ː싼","뒫ː싼"]},{"id":"38f6115d3f97fe27","term":"산짐승","zh":"野兽","audio":"/audio/38f6115d3f97fe270818.mp3","entryId":"61809","definition":"生活在山中的兽类。","pronunciation":["산찜승"]},{"id":"4bd2b4778a4cf299","term":"여럿","zh":"多个，许多","audio":"/audio/4bd2b4778a4cf299cd75.mp3","entryId":"15207","definition":"许多个。","pronunciation":["여럳"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c939e98f57c0ed587163.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73448-1-9-2","ko":"그렇군요. 안 그래도 오는 길에 여우 울음 소리가 들리던데요.","zh":"原来如此。我来的路上还听到过狐狸的叫声呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그렇군요.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇군요","audio":"/audio/d534da9131ab2bb94d78.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"그래도","meaning":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","explanation":"그래도：“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"그래도","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36264","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래도","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3"}},{"text":"오는","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오는","audio":"/audio/204311ae50badf5e3adb.mp3"}},{"text":"길에","meaning":"路上","explanation":"길：路上；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"9","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"길에","audio":"/audio/3da624f850700909d5a4.mp3"}},{"text":"여우","meaning":"狐狸","explanation":"여우：狐狸","readings":[{"term":"여우","audio":"/audio/d600b99daf4af7749ed8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73448","senseId":"1","lemma":"여우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여우","audio":"/audio/d600b99daf4af7749ed8.mp3"}},{"text":"울음","meaning":"哭泣，哭","explanation":"울음：哭泣，哭","readings":[{"term":"울음","audio":"/audio/cc40889db0d47966af9d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69526","senseId":"1","lemma":"울음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"울음","audio":"/audio/cc40889db0d47966af9d.mp3"}},{"text":"소리가","meaning":"声音，声，音，动静","explanation":"소리：声音，声，音，动静；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62379","senseId":"1","lemma":"소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소리가","audio":"/audio/0c12216fc63402c5db52.mp3"}},{"text":"들리던데요.","meaning":"听到，传来","explanation":"들리다：听到，传来；던데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"들리다","audio":"/audio/f5d8f68f409d3cd71df1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70783","senseId":"1","lemma":"들리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들리던데요","audio":"/audio/eedef3f2f6fad1d3ff97.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"82bd547e58bb6509","term":"그래도","zh":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3","entryId":"36264","definition":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"到达想去的地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"d72c843458543667","term":"길","zh":"路上","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3","entryId":"59251","definition":"移向某处的途中。","pronunciation":["길"]},{"id":"d600b99daf4af774","term":"여우","zh":"狐狸","audio":"/audio/d600b99daf4af7749ed8.mp3","entryId":"73448","definition":"跟狗相似而体型更瘦，毛色显黄褐色或红褐色，吻部较尖、尾巴粗长的动物。","pronunciation":["여우"]},{"id":"cc40889db0d47966","term":"울음","zh":"哭泣，哭","audio":"/audio/cc40889db0d47966af9d.mp3","entryId":"69526","definition":"指有声地流泪。","pronunciation":["우름"]},{"id":"d13cec79f66edb6a","term":"소리","zh":"声音，声，音，动静","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3","entryId":"62379","definition":"物体震动发出的音波传入耳朵中产生的响声。","pronunciation":["소리"]},{"id":"f5d8f68f409d3cd7","term":"들리다","zh":"听到，传来","audio":"/audio/f5d8f68f409d3cd71df1.mp3","entryId":"70783","definition":"通过耳朵接受声音。","pronunciation":["들리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cf72963684a36036bdff.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.486,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=73448","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":168,"sequenceScore":3.3127,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["原来如此。我来的路上还听到过狐狸的叫声呢。","今年我一定要戒烟成功。","那座后面的山上有很多野生动物。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["原来如此。我来的路上还听到过狐狸的叫声呢。","那座后面的山上有很多野生动物。","今年我一定要戒烟成功。"],"answer":0}]}
